kodi
# Binary add-ons from Debian arrive disabled and Kodi would ask at first start whether to enable each one
# (seen on a CI screenshot in stage 1). The TV session now seeds Kodi's add-on database before the first
# start (dai-tv seed, docs/TV.md §11), so they are simply there: live channels from the person's own playlist
# and adaptive streams.
kodi-pvr-iptvsimple
kodi-inputstream-adaptive
cec-utils
